                  "source": "PubMed"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Peptide hormone that act as potent hypotensive and vasodilatator agents (PubMed:8387282). ADM function is mediated by the CALCRL-RAMP2 and CALCRL-RAMP3 receptor complexes with ADM showing the highest potency for the CALCRL-RAMP2 complex (PubMed:32296767, PubMed:9620797)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
