                  "source": "PubMed"
                }
              ],
              "value": "Peptide hormone that act as potent hypotensive and vasodilatator agents by inhibiting catecholamine secretion from sympathetic nerve endings and adrenal chromaffin cells (PubMed:10588445, PubMed:9578982). Acts as a ligand for MRGPRX2 receptor in mast cells (PubMed:15823563)"
            }
